abstract: "A Model Context Protocol server exposing 6,503+ live-verified U.S. veteran resources across all 50 U.S. states plus DC and 5 territories. Includes VA hospitals, VA clinics, Vet Centers, county benefits offices, housing programs, employment services, and mental-health resources with integrated 988 Veterans Crisis Line routing. Operated by Wounded Warriors, a Texas 501(c)(3) public charity (EIN 86-1336741). Data licensed CC BY 4.0; code licensed MIT."
